meta {
  name: Member tags - Update
  type: http
  seq: 208
}

patch {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/member-tags/<tag cuid>
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "visibility": "members"
  }
}

docs {
  Renames a member tag, or changes its color or its visibility (#1389): owner and admins. Only the fields of the request change; a rename keeps the members of the tag. A change to members shows the tag on every member who has it. A tag with the visibility managers answers 404 to a caller who does not see every tag. Token ability: member-tags:write.
}
